# Research layout (Cursor Cloud research)

**Scope:** оркестратор **облачного исследования** в Cursor (ветки handoff, `cloud_in`/`cloud_out`).  
**Not this rule:** обычная разработка приложения / общий planner — другие agents/rules.

Read `future_research_rules.md` for the full tree. Short map:

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `docs/` | Stable brief — do not change without explicit ask |
| `progress/plan.md` | Stage machine (CURRENT, frozen stack, next) |
| `progress/log.md` | Short handoff / pull / closed lines |
| `cloud_in/` | Flat outbox to cloud (git) — rewrite each handoff |
| `cloud_out/` | Flat inbox from cloud (git) — agent commits here |
| `data/` | Raw + gold (ignore) — never mutate originals; copy if needed |
| `results/{stage}/` | Accepted artifacts after ingest (ignore) |
| `prompts/` | Prompt archive (ignore) |
| `scripts/` | Shared runners (git) |
| `.cursor/` | Orchestrator only (ignore) — not for cloud |

**Stop:** do not copy `eval/` into `cloud_in/`; do not put secrets in git; do not invent gold labels in `cloud_in/inputs/`. Gold may live on `main` for local checks — cloud role still forbids reading it.

**Phases:** planning → `research-plan` rule; pack/push → `cloud-handoff`; pull/merge → `cloud-ingest`. Cloud infra → skill `cloud-agent-setup`.
